#. i18n: file: kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_general.ui:151
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_autoConnect)
#: rc.cpp:328
msgid "Connect on startup and when a network is available"
msgstr "Bi't Starten tokoppeln, oder wenn en Nettwark praat steiht"

#. i18n: file: kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_general.ui:154
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_autoConnect)
#: rc.cpp:331
msgid ""
"When starting Kopete, and whenever your computer is online, all your "
"accounts will be connected automatically. You can exclude accounts "
"individually in their properties."
msgstr ""
"Bi't Starten koppelt Kopete all Kontos automaatsch to, oder jümmers, wenn "
"Dien Reekner tokoppelt is. Du kannst dor enkelte Kontos över ehr "
"Egenschappen vun utnehmen."

#. i18n: file: kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_general.ui:157
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_autoConnect)
#: rc.cpp:334
msgid "Connect automatically"
msgstr "Automaatsch tokoppeln"

