#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_trayflashNotify)
#: rc.cpp:343
msgid "Animate the system tray icon on an incoming message"
msgstr "Bi ankamen Narichten dat Systeemafsnitt-Lüttbild animeren"

#. i18n: file: kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_events.ui:40
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_trayflashNotify)
#: rc.cpp:346
msgid "Animate the system tray icon whenever a message comes in."
msgstr "Dat Systeemafsnitt-Lüttbild jümmers animeren, wenn en Naricht ankummt."

#. i18n: file: kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_events.ui:43
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_trayflashNotify)
#: rc.cpp:349
msgid "Animate s&ystem tray icon"
msgstr "S&ysteemafsnitt-Lüttbild animeren"

#. i18n: file: kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_events.ui:77
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_trayflashNotifyLeftClickOpensMessage)
#: rc.cpp:352
msgid ""
"Left mouse click on flashing system tray opens message instead of restoring/"
"minimizing contact list"
msgstr ""
"Linksklick op blinken Systeemafsnitt-Lüttbild maakt Naricht op, "
"Kontaktenlist warrt nich wedderherstellt/minimeert"

#. i18n: file: kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_events.ui:80
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_trayflashNotifyLeftClickOpensMessage)
#: rc.cpp:355
msgid ""
"A left mouse click on the flashing system tray icon opens the incoming "
"message instead of restoring/minimizing the contact list (e.g. to check who "
"is sending messages). A middle click always opens this message."
msgstr ""
"En Linksklick op dat blinken Systeemafsnitt-Lüttbild maakt de ankamen "
"Naricht op, de Kontaktenlist warrt nich wedderherstellt oder minimeert (so "
"kannst Du t.B. nakieken, wokeen de Naricht sendt hett). En Middelklick maakt "
"jümmers de Naricht op."

#. i18n: file: kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_events.ui:83
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_trayflashNotifyLeftClickOpensMessage)
#: rc.cpp:358
msgid "&Left mouse click opens message"
msgstr "&Linksklick maakt Naricht op"

#. i18n: file: kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_events.ui:100
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_balloonNotifyIgnoreClosesChatView)
#: rc.cpp:361
msgid ""
"The \"Ignore\" button of the new message popup closes the chat window for "
"the sender"
msgstr ""
"De Knoop \"Övergahn\" vun den Opdukbescheed maakt dat Klöönfinster för den "
"Senner to"

#. i18n: file: kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_events.ui:103
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_balloonNotifyIgnoreClosesChatView)
#: rc.cpp:364
msgid ""
"If there is already a chat window opened for the sender of the message "
"displayed in the new message popup the \"Ignore\" button will close this "
"chat window."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dat al en apen Klöönfinster för den Senner vun de Naricht gifft, op de "
"de Opdukbescheed henwiest, maakt de Knoop \"Övergahn\" dit Finster to."

#. i18n: file: kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_events.ui:106
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_balloonNotifyIgnoreClosesChatView)
#: rc.cpp:367
msgid "Button \"I&gnore\" in new message popups closes chat"
msgstr "\"Över&gahn\"-Knoop binnen Opdukbescheed maakt Klöönruum to"

#. i18n: file: kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_events.ui:115
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_queueOnlyHighlightedMessagesInGroupChats)
#: rc.cpp:370
msgid "Notify only highlighted messages in groupchats"
msgstr "Bescheden bloots för rutheevt Narichten binnen Koppel-Klöönrüüm"

#. i18n: file: kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_events.ui:118
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_queueOnlyHighlightedMessagesInGroupChats)
#: rc.cpp:373
msgid ""
"In very active groupchats important messages can be singled out by excluding "
"non-highlighted messages from notification."
msgstr ""
"In Koppel-Klöönrüüm, binnen de dat bannig to Kehr geiht,  laat sik wichtige "
"Narichten beter utschutern, wenn för nich rutheevt Narichten keen Bescheed "
"geven warrt."

#. i18n: file: kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_events.ui:121
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_queueOnlyHighlightedMessagesInGroupChats)
#: rc.cpp:376
msgid "Exclude non-&highlighted messages in groupchats"
msgstr "Nich &rutheevt Narichten in Koppel-Klöönrüüm utsluten"

#. i18n: file: kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_events.ui:128
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_queueOnlyMessagesOnAnotherDesktop)
#: rc.cpp:379
msgid ""
"Use the same notifications for events in the active chat window and other "
"chat windows on the current desktop (usually less intrusive)"
msgstr ""
"De sülven Bescheden för Begeefnissen binnen dat aktuelle un anner "
"Klöönfinsters op den aktuellen Schriefdisch bruken (normalerwies minn "
"opdringen)"

#. i18n: file: kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_events.ui:132
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_queueOnlyMessagesOnAnotherDesktop)
#: rc.cpp:382
msgid ""
"If activated, events for chat windows that are on the current desktop will "
"be handled like events in the active chat window: The system tray icon and "
"the sender icon in the contact list are not animated and the \"Incoming "
"Message for Active Chat\" event is used for the notification. Chat windows "
"on other desktops will trigger notifications.\n"
"If not activated, all chat windows except the active one will notify you "
"that an event has occured using animations (if activated) and the \"Incoming "
"Message\" event."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, warrt Begeefnissen för all Klöönfinstern op den aktuellen "
"Schriefdisch jüst so hanteert as Begeefnissen binnen dat aktuelle Finster. "
"Systeemafsnitt-Lüttbild un Senner-Lüttbild op de Kontaktenlist warrt nich "
"animeert, un dat Begeefnis \"Ankamen Naricht binnen aktiev Klöönruum\" warrt "
"bruukt. Klöönfinstern op anner Schriefdischen lööst Bescheden ut.\n"
"Wenn nich anmaakt, geevt all Klöönfinstern, utbenahmen dat aktive, över "
"Begeefnissen mit Animeren (wenn anmaakt) un dat Begeefnis \"Ankamen Naricht"
"\" Bescheed."

#. i18n: file: kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_events.ui:135
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_queueOnlyMessagesOnAnotherDesktop)
#: rc.cpp:386
msgid "Treat all chats on the current des&ktop like active chats"
msgstr "All Klöönrüüm op den aktuellen Schrief&disch beert sik as anmaakt"

#. i18n: file: kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_events.ui:157
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_enableEventsWhileAway)
#: rc.cpp:392
msgid "Enable events if your account status is \"Away\""
msgstr "Bescheden tolaten, ok wenn de Konto-Status op \"Weg\" steiht"

#. i18n: file: kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_events.ui:160
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_enableEventsWhileAway)
#: rc.cpp:395
msgid ""
"Enable notification events even if your account status is \"Away\" or less "
"available, e.g. \"Not Available\" or \"Do not Disturb\". Note: This does not "
"affect the flashing of the system tray icon."
msgstr ""
"Bescheden ok denn tolaten, wenn de Konto-Status \"Weg\" oder weniger "
"verföögbor is, t.B. \"Nich verföögbor\" oder \"Nich stören\". Beacht bitte: "
"Disse Optschoon gellt nich för dat Blinken vun dat Systeemafsnitt-Lüttbild."

#. i18n: file: kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_events.ui:163
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_enableEventsWhileAway)
#: rc.cpp:398
msgid "E&nable events while away"
msgstr "Bescheden wielt We&gwesen tolaten"

#. i18n: file: kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_events.ui:170
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_trayflashNotifySetCurrentDesktopToChatView)
#: rc.cpp:401
msgid ""
"Switch to the desktop which contains the chat window for the sender when "
"opening his/her message"
msgstr ""
"Bi't Opmaken vun en Naricht na den Schriefdisch wesseln, op den dat "
"Klöönfinster för den Senner liggt."

#. i18n: file: kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_events.ui:173
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_trayflashNotifySetCurrentDesktopToChatView)
#: rc.cpp:404
msgid ""
"If there is already a chat window open for the sender of the message, "
"opening his/her message will cause a switch to the desktop which contains "
"this chat window."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dor al en Klöönfinster för den Senner vun de Naricht apen is, wesselt "
"Kopete na den Schriefdisch mit dit Finster, wenn Du de Naricht vun den "
"Senner opmaakst."

#. i18n: file: kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_events.ui:176
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_trayflashNotifySetCurrentDesktopToChatView)
#: rc.cpp:407
msgid "Switch &to desktop containing chat on opening message"
msgstr "Bi't Opmaken vun en Naricht na Schrie&fdisch mit Klöönfinster wesseln"

#. i18n: file: kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_events.ui:183
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_raiseMessageWindow)
#: rc.cpp:410
msgid "Raise the chat window/tab on an incoming message"
msgstr "Dat Klöönfinster / de Koort bi ankamen Narichten na vörn stellen"

#. i18n: file: kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_events.ui:186
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_raiseMessageWindow)
#: rc.cpp:413
msgid ""
"If there is already a chat window opened for the sender of an incoming "
"message this window will be put on the current desktop and in front of all "
"other windows."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dor al en Finster för den Senner vun en ankamen Naricht apen is, warrt "
"dit Finster na den aktuellen Schriefdisch verschaven un vöran all anner "
"Finstern stellt."

#. i18n: file: kopete/config/behavior/behaviorconfig_events.ui:189
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_raiseMessageWindow)
#: rc.cpp:416
msgid "&Raise window on incoming message"
msgstr "&Finster bi ankamen Narichten na vörn stellen"

