msgstr "Apen &IP-Adress:"

#. i18n: file: protocols/jabber/ui/dlgjabbereditaccountwidget.ui:814
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel3)
#: rc.cpp:4925
msgid ""
"<i><ul><li>The information in the \"public IP address\" and \"port\" fields "
"applies to all Jabber accounts.</li>\n"
"<li>You can leave the \"public IP address\" empty if your computer is "
"directly connected to the internet.</li>\n"
"<li>A hostname is also valid.</li>\n"
"<li>Changes to these fields will only take effect the next time you start "
"Kopete.</li>\n"
"<li>The \"Proxy JID\" can be configured per account.</li></ul></i>"
msgstr ""
"<i><ul><li>De Weerten binnen \"Apen IP-Adress\" un \"Port\" gellt för all "
"Jabber-Kontos.</li>\n"
"<li>Wenn Dien Reekner direktemang dat Internet tokoppelt is, kannst Du dat "
"Feld \"Apen IP-Adress\" leddig laten.</li>\n"
"<li>Ok en Reeknernaam gellt.</li>\n"
"<li>Ännern warrt eerst bi den nakamen Start vun Kopete bruukt.</li>\n"
"<li>Du kannst de \"Proxy-JID\" för elk Konto enkel fastleggen.</li></ul></i>"

#. i18n: file: protocols/jabber/ui/dlgjabbereditaccountwidget.ui:868
#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QGroupBox, groupBox_7)
#: rc.cpp:4935
msgid "General Privacy"
msgstr "Allgemeen Privaatrebeet"

#. i18n: file: protocols/jabber/ui/dlgjabbereditaccountwidget.ui:889
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, cbHideSystemInfo)
#: rc.cpp:4938
msgid ""
"By default, Kopete gives the other users some info about your system and the "
"client. Checking this box will hide that information."
msgstr ""
"Standardwies gifft Kopete anner Brukers en poor Informatschonen över Dien "
"Systeem un dat Client-Programm. Maak dit an, wenn Du dat nich wullt."

#. i18n: file: protocols/jabber/ui/dlgjabbereditaccountwidget.ui:892
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, cbHideSystemInfo)
#: rc.cpp:4941
msgid "&Hide system and client info"
msgstr "Systeem- un Clientinformatschonen &versteken"

#. i18n: file: protocols/jabber/ui/dlgjabbereditaccountwidget.ui:942
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, cbSendEvents)
#: rc.cpp:4947
msgid ""
"Check this box if you always want to send notifications to your contacts."
msgstr "Maak dit an, wenn Du Dien Kontakten jümmers Bescheden tostüern wullt"

#. i18n: file: protocols/jabber/ui/dlgjabbereditaccountwidget.ui:945
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, cbSendEvents)
#: rc.cpp:4950
msgid "Always send not&ifications"
msgstr "Jümmers &Bescheden loosstüern"

#. i18n: file: protocols/jabber/ui/dlgjabbereditaccountwidget.ui:1008
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, cbSendDeliveredEvent)
#: rc.cpp:4953
msgid ""
"<qt>Check this box to send the <b>Delivered notification</b> to your "
"contacts : when a message is delivered to Kopete, Kopete can notify your "
"contact that it has received the message.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Maak dit an, wenn Du Dien Kontakten <b>Utlevert-Bescheden</b> tostüern "
"wullt: Warrt en Naricht utlevert, kann Kopete Dien Kontakt dor över Bescheed "
"geven, dat se ankamen is.</qt>"

#. i18n: file: protocols/jabber/ui/dlgjabbereditaccountwidget.ui:1011
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, cbSendDeliveredEvent)
#: rc.cpp:4956
msgid "Alwa&ys send delivered notifications"
msgstr "Jümmers \"&Utlevert\"-Bescheed loosstüern"

#. i18n: file: protocols/jabber/ui/dlgjabbereditaccountwidget.ui:1024
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, cbSendDisplayedEvent)
#: rc.cpp:4959
msgid ""
"<qt>Check this box to send the <b>Displayed notification</b> to your "
"contacts : when a message is displayed in Kopete, Kopete can notify your "
"contact that it has displayed the message.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Maak dit an, wenn Du Dien Kontakten <b>Wiest-Bescheden</b> tostüern "
"wullt: Wenn en Naricht wiest warrt, kann Kopete Dien Kontakt dor över "
"Bescheed geven, dat se wiest wöör.</qt>"

#. i18n: file: protocols/jabber/ui/dlgjabbereditaccountwidget.ui:1027
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, cbSendDisplayedEvent)
#: rc.cpp:4962
msgid "Al&ways send displayed notifications"
msgstr "Jümmers \"&Wiest\"-Bescheed loosstüern"

#. i18n: file: protocols/jabber/ui/dlgjabbereditaccountwidget.ui:1040
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, cbSendComposingEvent)
#: rc.cpp:4965
msgid ""
"<qt>Check this box to send the <b>Typing notification</b> to your contacts : "
"when you are composing a message, you might want your contact to know that "
"you are typing so that he/she knows you are answering.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Maak dit an, wenn Du Dien Kontakten <b>Tipp-Bescheden</b> tostüern "
"wullt: Wenn Du en Naricht ingiffst, kriggt Dien Kontakt dor Bescheed över, "
"dat Du bi büst to tippen. So weet he, dat Du em anterst.</qt>"

#. i18n: file: protocols/jabber/ui/dlgjabbereditaccountwidget.ui:1043
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, cbSendComposingEvent)
#: rc.cpp:4968
msgid "Always send &typing notifications"
msgstr "Jümmers \"Bi to &tippen\"-Bescheed loosstüern"

#. i18n: file: protocols/jabber/ui/dlgjabbereditaccountwidget.ui:1053
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, cbSendGoneEvent)
#: rc.cpp:4971
msgid "Always send &gone notifications (closing the window)"
msgstr "Jümmers \"&Rutgungen\"-Bescheed loosstüern (Tomaken vun't Finster)"

